# V2-10 (d) the mountains on the huge planet of seed 7, each at a place in its realm (`x=`, `z=`):
# the Old World's alpine meadows (an ibex herd), krummholz, rock and ice, and its montane larch
# and fir forest in summer (chamois) and in autumn's gold; the Andes' puna (vicuñas), their lenga
# forest in autumn from above it and their tree line of monkey puzzles; East Africa's Afroalpine
# moor of giant groundsels, lobelias and tree heath (geladas) and its mountain forest of pencil
# cedars and yellowwoods; then their animals, close (the Rockies' on the Old World's meadow: this
# planet's Nearctic has no mountains). Seasons are the place's own (`season=`, `@` how far into
# it). `hearth --screenshot-list tools/shots/v210_mountain.shots`
